        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Grasping Foliage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(primal, transmutation)\n\nTrigger: The assassin vine detects a creature within 20 feet via tremorsense\n\nThe assassin vine causes vegetation within a 20-foot emanation to writhe for 1 round, turning this area into difficult terrain. When a creature starts its turn in this area, it must attempt a 20 Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a \u201310-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure it is also immobilized for 1 round. A creature can attempt to Escape to remove these effects.\n\nAssassin vines are immune to Grasping Foliage."
            },
